Article 3
Objectives The objectives of protection for women and children victims of violence are:
a. to guarantee the fulfillment of the rights of women and/or children in accordance with applicable provisions;
b. to prevent and protect women and/or children from acts of violence;
c. to encourage the community to carry out its obligations in the prevention and protection of women and children in accordance with applicable legislative provisions; and
d. to restore victims from the consequences of acts of violence experienced.

